# Bestial Bloodline: "{4}{G}: Return this card from your graveyard to your hand." On turn 1 Bot1's Black Lotus pays the Aura's {1}{G}
# (cast on its Ornithopter) and, with four Moxen tapped, five mana with a green among it is in the pool: the ability is refused while the
# Aura is on the battlefield (it works from a graveyard only). Bot2's Disenchant puts it into the graveyard on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 has
# five sources that make no green (four Moxen and a Plains) and no green source anywhere: the ability is refused, the {G} being a colored
# symbol. On turn 5 a Forest's green mana with the Moxen pays it, and the card goes to Bot1's hand.

